// Red Noir: one post-process shader turns the world black, white and grey,
// and keeps only the red of blood. The ZScript handler switches it on and
// sets its uniforms from the noir_* CVars (CVARINFO), so the menu changes it
// live. All uniforms are integers (percent, degrees, tics).
HardwareShader PostProcess scene
{
	Name "RedNoir"
	Shader "shaders/rednoir.fp" 330
	Uniform int mode
	Uniform int tics
	Uniform int contrast
	Uniform int grain
	Uniform int vignette
}
